  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Financial Inclusion - JOA</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will be done in partnership with the United Nations Capital Development Funds, and is in response to a Jersey Overseas Aid call for proposals. Its overarching objective is that socio-economically resilient women are less vulnerable to SGBV, through three project outcomes:
1: Women actively participate in pro-poor, gender based, formal financial services,&#xA0;delivered by a financial sector safely and sustainably
2: Women have more credit to start or improve their own businesses
3: Women are more aware of their rights, SGBV risks and consequences, and have&#xA0;increased access to SGBV response services</narrative>
  </description>
